        'Present: Played mostly by traditional card enthusiasts and historians.',
        '20th Century: Replaced in most gambling circles by Poker or more standardized trick-takers.',
      ],
      evolution: "The game simplified earlier complex trick rules to focus entirely on the 'Sneak' or 'Pass' decision binary.",
      cultural: "Used as the prototype for the 'Sneak' maneuver in many other Central European games.",
